OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity staff warned of
OL,4,A'difficult decisions' ahead over
OL,5,Afinances
OL,6,
OL,7,FStaff at Queen's University of Belfast
OL,8,F(QUB) have been warned of "difficult
OL,9,Fdecisions" ahead due to the
OL,10,Funiversity's finances.
OL,12,FPay deals with staff, and childcare and
OL,13,Fgym fees for staff and students are
OL,14,Funder review while staff car-parking
OL,15,Fcharges are going up.
OL,17,FThe details came in an message to staff
OL,18,Ffrom the university's vice-chancellor
OL,19,FProf Sir Ian Greer.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
